@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Individual user" as User
actor "Group owner / manager" as Manager
actor "Expense reviewer" as Reviewer

rectangle "SplitSmart (full product; proposed)" {
  component "Browser client\nNFR-001" as WebClient
  component "Swing MVP client\nprototype only" as SwingClient
  component "Application use cases\nand domain rules" as App
}

cloud "Email delivery\nprovider not selected" as Email
cloud "Expense notification\nchannel not selected" as Notify
cloud "Private receipt storage\nprovider not selected" as Receipt

User --> WebClient
User --> SwingClient
Manager --> WebClient
Manager --> SwingClient
Reviewer --> WebClient
Reviewer --> SwingClient
WebClient --> App
SwingClient --> App
App --> Email : verification / reset
App --> Notify : authorized expense notice
App --> Receipt : private receipt bytes

note bottom of SwingClient
Swing-only delivery does not satisfy NFR-001.
Platform decision requires stakeholder approval.
end note
@enduml
